  "system": {
    "identifier": "yoton-lava-release-lava-rock",
    "description": "<p>You conjuring a mass of lava, that you launch at a target you can see within range. Make a ranged ninjutsu attack, on a hit you deal 4d8 Fire damage as magma splashes outward and quickly cools. All creatures within 5 feet of the original target must make a Dexterity saving throw having their speed reduced by half on a failure, until the end of their next turns.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, and the attacks damage by 1d8. If this jutsu is cast at B-Rank or higher, creatures who fail their saving throw have their speed reduced to 0 for the duration.</p>",
